# FleetMan backend (Spring Boot, same backend as the web front).
# Web build or emulator on the same machine: http://localhost:8081
# Android emulator: http://10.0.2.2:8081
# Physical phone (Expo Go / dev build): use your computer's LAN IP, e.g. http://192.168.1.20:8081
# (find it with `ip -4 addr` on Linux, `ipconfig` on Windows). Phone and computer must share the same Wi-Fi.
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:8081
